    "enabled": true,
    "productName": "QTsignalApp",
    "productVersion": "6.2.0",
    "companyName": "",
    "description": "Interactive electrostatic, magnetostatic and RF/EM field explorer with antenna geometry design, link-budget calculations, configurable UI themes, 2D TMz/TEz FDTD with CPML/modal guide ports, Smith/network analysis, BEM capacitance, thin-wire MoM antennas, geometric coil coupling, probes and passive-component calculations, engineering wave/antenna/EM calculator",
